WEBVTT

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:28.292
How shameful...

00:00:32.583 --> 00:00:34.500
Ah, the rich girl is here.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.000
She's alone again.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.708
Some pretty girl is acting arrogant.

00:00:47.083 --> 00:00:51.708
I don't care if I'm always by myself.

00:00:51.708 --> 00:00:53.333
I don't care...

00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:55.042
Shino!

00:01:00.167 --> 00:01:02.083
Akari!

00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:03.625
Shino!

00:01:03.625 --> 00:01:04.708
Akari!

00:01:04.708 --> 00:01:06.042
Shino!

00:01:06.042 --> 00:01:07.542
Akari!

00:01:14.417 --> 00:01:15.917
Akari...

00:02:48.417 --> 00:02:50.667
Aria!

00:02:50.667 --> 00:02:54.042
I'm sorry! Did I make you wait?!

00:02:54.042 --> 00:02:57.167
Akari Mamiya. You're five minutes late.

00:02:57.167 --> 00:03:00.292
As a <i>butei</i>, you should always be punctual,

00:03:00.292 --> 00:03:02.750
especially since you're my Amica.

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:04.125
Be more careful from now on.

00:03:04.125 --> 00:03:05.125
Yes, ma'am!

00:03:10.833 --> 00:03:15.042
She's taking the time to meet up
with me, and yet I made a blunder...

00:03:15.042 --> 00:03:19.542
I went ahead and submitted a report of
our Amica contract to the school for now.

00:03:19.542 --> 00:03:22.875
But that doesn't mean that I've accepted you.

00:03:22.875 --> 00:03:24.500
You haven't forgotten, have you?

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:28.042
Until you take this back, I won't
officially accept you as my Amica.

00:03:28.042 --> 00:03:29.542
I-I understand!

00:03:29.542 --> 00:03:32.375
If you find an opportunity,
come at me at any time.

00:03:32.375 --> 00:03:33.708
Roger that!

00:03:36.792 --> 00:03:39.458
But just jumping on me won't help you get it.

00:03:39.458 --> 00:03:40.458
Let's go.

00:03:40.458 --> 00:03:43.042
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:03:43.042 --> 00:03:45.667
At Butei High, where students are trained
to become full-fledged armed detectives,

00:03:45.667 --> 00:03:48.208
there's a system called Amica.

00:03:48.208 --> 00:03:50.375
Upperclassmen train their juniors,

00:03:50.375 --> 00:03:54.208
and they refer to each other
as older sister and younger sister.

00:03:54.208 --> 00:03:57.000
I've become Aria's Amica...

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.875
although I'm still in training.

00:03:59.875 --> 00:04:03.625
I'm really walking with Aria!

00:04:03.625 --> 00:04:06.417
One day, I'll have Aria accept me!

00:04:06.417 --> 00:04:09.083
And I'll officially become her Amica!

00:04:12.917 --> 00:04:13.792
This is the place.

00:04:13.792 --> 00:04:16.667
Whoa! It's a VIP room in the women's dorm!

00:04:16.667 --> 00:04:18.083
Hm?

00:04:20.792 --> 00:04:24.583
The first thing we do as
Amica is to share our room key.

00:04:24.583 --> 00:04:26.750
I'll ask you to assist me in many things.

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:28.792
Yes, ma'am! I'll do my best!

00:04:28.792 --> 00:04:30.708
A chance!

00:04:30.708 --> 00:04:33.125
Come in.

00:04:33.125 --> 00:04:35.500
Whoa... This room is big!

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:39.250
It is? My room at my parents' house
was about ten times bigger than this.

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:42.458
T-T-Ten times?!

00:04:45.958 --> 00:04:50.375
You might know this,
but I'm from a noble family.

00:04:50.375 --> 00:04:51.958
The oldest daughter of the Holmes family.

00:04:51.958 --> 00:04:53.000
Holmes?

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:56.458
Sherlock Holmes. You've seen
his name in textbooks, haven't you?

00:04:56.458 --> 00:04:57.958
I'm the fourth generation.

00:04:57.958 --> 00:05:02.292
Whoa... I've learned Aria's amazing secret!

00:05:02.292 --> 00:05:06.625
Hey, can you contact Amdo
and SSR and order silver bullets

00:05:06.625 --> 00:05:08.042
to fight against stealth criminals?

00:05:08.042 --> 00:05:09.292
Huh?

00:05:09.292 --> 00:05:12.417
How about assembling a Yagi antenna?

00:05:12.417 --> 00:05:16.125
Marksmanship, driving, forensics...
It doesn't matter what.

00:05:16.125 --> 00:05:17.792
What's your special skill?

00:05:25.208 --> 00:05:26.125
What's this?

00:05:26.125 --> 00:05:28.333
It's a paraglider that I use in operations.

00:05:28.333 --> 00:05:31.083
I'm in the middle of improving
its turning capabilities.

00:05:31.083 --> 00:05:34.708
I haven't stitched it together,
so follow these instructions and sew.

00:05:34.708 --> 00:05:36.000
O-Okay!

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:39.500
All you have to do is sew based on
the instructions. You can do it, can't you?

00:05:42.042 --> 00:05:45.167
I have to go take care of something.

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:56.875
Akari's walk and stance were
based off of Japanese martial arts.

00:05:56.875 --> 00:06:01.000
But it's not karate, judo, or aikido.

00:06:05.542 --> 00:06:09.208
The technique you saw was probably Tobiugachi.

00:06:09.208 --> 00:06:12.250
Essentially, it's one of the
ninja's killing methods in which they

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:14.250
pull out an enemy's eyeballs and
internal organs with their bare hands.

00:06:16.542 --> 00:06:18.125
This is for the additional task.

00:06:18.125 --> 00:06:19.333
Investigate her in more detail.

00:06:19.333 --> 00:06:22.208
Whoa! Thank you!

00:06:22.208 --> 00:06:24.375
She's quite cheap.

00:06:24.375 --> 00:06:29.750
As you requested, I'll look
into Akari Mamiya further.

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:31.625
Something bothers me about her, too, so...

00:06:36.125 --> 00:06:37.875
Ow!

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:41.417
This is...

00:06:44.042 --> 00:06:47.208
...about the only thing I can do...

00:06:54.667 --> 00:06:56.833
It's gotten late.

00:07:04.417 --> 00:07:07.292
Has she been sewing all this time?

00:07:08.958 --> 00:07:11.250
It's all done...

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:13.667
I thought it'd take at least two days.

00:07:19.583 --> 00:07:22.167
Aria!

00:07:22.167 --> 00:07:23.583
The way you sewed...

00:07:23.583 --> 00:07:28.000
I backstitched. I thought
it should be strong, so...

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:29.417
Backstitch?

00:07:29.417 --> 00:07:32.167
You pull the cloth to
the side with every stitch,

00:07:32.167 --> 00:07:35.125
and use the same needle hole to sew.

00:07:35.125 --> 00:07:38.958
This is the best way to hand-sew
pieces of cloth together to make it strong.

00:07:38.958 --> 00:07:42.500
Uhm... if that's not good, I'll redo it!

00:07:43.708 --> 00:07:46.500
How couldn't it be good? Thanks.

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:49.292
I've found one of your strong points.

00:07:49.292 --> 00:07:51.125
You're a good girl.

00:07:53.167 --> 00:07:55.417
Aria!

00:07:55.417 --> 00:07:57.292
Wh-What's the matter? What's wrong?

00:07:57.292 --> 00:08:00.958
Nothing... Nothing's wrong!

00:08:00.958 --> 00:08:03.125
She really is a strange girl.

00:08:03.125 --> 00:08:05.708
I wonder what she's like in everyday life...

00:08:09.458 --> 00:08:15.250
And then, Aria used the paraglider that
I sewed together during the incident this morning!

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:18.000
Oh? Then you <i>were </i>helpful, huh?

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:23.500
Yep! I worked hard to sew
together that paraglider for Aria!

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:27.042
For Aria...

00:08:27.042 --> 00:08:30.125
She came whooshing in from
the sky and rescued the victim!

00:08:30.125 --> 00:08:32.500
Aria is so cool!

00:08:33.917 --> 00:08:37.667
She submitted our Amica contract to the school.

00:08:37.667 --> 00:08:41.583
But until I get my gun back,
I'll be in training.

00:08:41.583 --> 00:08:43.458
What are you using now?

00:08:43.458 --> 00:08:47.542
My other gun, a 25-round Micro-Uzi.

00:08:47.542 --> 00:08:49.875
It has its own merit.

00:08:49.875 --> 00:08:51.667
Well, looks like it'll take quite a long time

00:08:51.667 --> 00:08:54.750
before she officially accepts you as her Amica.

00:08:54.750 --> 00:09:00.042
Yep, but I'm gonna become
Aria's Amica one day for sure!

00:09:00.042 --> 00:09:02.042
Well, shall we head home now?

00:09:02.042 --> 00:09:04.875
Oh, yeah! Let's go get some Leaf Pies
from that store! It's been a while.

00:09:04.875 --> 00:09:06.417
Oh, I can't do that today.

00:09:06.417 --> 00:09:06.958
What?

00:09:06.958 --> 00:09:11.042
Aria will be spending some nights away,
so I have to help her prepare.

00:09:11.042 --> 00:09:14.042
I have to pack her nightgowns and underwear.

00:09:14.042 --> 00:09:16.792
Besides, I can't eat sweets right now.

00:09:16.792 --> 00:09:19.125
When I stayed overnight
at her place the other day,

00:09:19.125 --> 00:09:22.208
she told me to lose some weight.

00:09:22.208 --> 00:09:24.667
She stayed overnight?!

00:09:24.667 --> 00:09:27.208
Well then, later, Raika, Shino!

00:09:27.208 --> 00:09:31.750
Yeah, yeah. Just do the best you can.

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:33.542
Hm? What's wrong?

00:09:33.542 --> 00:09:37.542
N-Nothing. I just felt a little dizzy.

00:09:37.542 --> 00:09:41.292
She's been talking about Aria all this time.

00:09:41.292 --> 00:09:43.375
She must really like her.

00:09:43.375 --> 00:09:45.167
Shall we go home, too?

00:09:45.167 --> 00:09:47.375
Do you wanna go have some Leaf Pies?

00:09:47.375 --> 00:09:53.000
No... Well... I suddenly
feel a little sick, so...

00:09:58.375 --> 00:10:00.292
Do you have some business with our class?

00:10:00.292 --> 00:10:03.208
N-No, never mind.

00:10:05.417 --> 00:10:08.167
Welcome back, Miss Shino.

00:10:08.167 --> 00:10:10.333
I'll take your bag.

00:10:10.333 --> 00:10:12.875
What's wrong, Miss Shino?

00:10:12.875 --> 00:10:14.792
You seem to be upset.

00:10:14.792 --> 00:10:16.292
Shut up!

00:10:20.333 --> 00:10:23.417
What's with Akari?!
She keeps saying Aria this, Aria that!

00:10:23.417 --> 00:10:26.667
Akari is <i>my </i>friend!

00:10:26.667 --> 00:10:29.917
Aria! Aria! Aria! Ahhh!

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:35.625
If I don't do something,
Aria will take Akari away from me.

00:10:35.625 --> 00:10:37.625
Calm down, Shino.

00:10:37.625 --> 00:10:39.958
First, I need to use the Akari box...

00:10:39.958 --> 00:10:41.708
...and take in...

00:10:44.083 --> 00:10:45.958
...Akari's essence!

00:10:45.958 --> 00:10:51.417
Ahh... Akari! We'll be friends forever, right?!

00:10:51.417 --> 00:10:55.625
Now that we've become friends,
we'll be friends forever!

00:10:55.625 --> 00:10:57.292
Yep, yep. We will!

00:10:57.292 --> 00:11:02.375
Leaf Pies taste good,
don't they? Have mine, too.

00:11:02.375 --> 00:11:05.833
Hey! This is no time for escaping from reality!

00:11:08.333 --> 00:11:09.833
"Butei High Underground Website" "Profiles of Top Students"
"Name: Aria H. Kanzaki (Aria Holmes Kanzaki)"

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:11.917
Aria H. Kanzaki...

00:11:11.917 --> 00:11:14.875
An S-Ranked <i>butei</i>. Aria the Quadra.

00:11:14.875 --> 00:11:18.000
She has belonged to the London
Bureau of Butei since the age of 14.

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:22.708
Succeeded in arresting
heinous criminals 99 times in a row.

00:11:22.708 --> 00:11:23.875
She's strong...

00:11:23.875 --> 00:11:28.333
It's dangerous to try eliminating her directly.

00:11:28.333 --> 00:11:30.958
Miss Shino. I brought your dinner.

00:11:30.958 --> 00:11:33.083
Just leave it there!

00:11:36.417 --> 00:11:40.833
Th-This is it! This is how
I can take Akari back!

00:11:47.708 --> 00:11:50.958
Aria, when are you coming back?

00:11:50.958 --> 00:11:56.542
Well, I don't know, but you should
keep working hard on your own.

00:11:56.542 --> 00:11:57.708
You can do it, right?

00:11:57.708 --> 00:12:00.167
Yes! I will do as you say!

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:06.417
--Ow!
--Make sure you lock the door.

00:12:06.417 --> 00:12:07.500
Okay.

00:12:08.875 --> 00:12:12.000
Have a safe trip, Aria.

00:12:13.875 --> 00:12:16.000
Aria?

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:19.958
Never mind. Let's go.

00:12:19.958 --> 00:12:21.708
So what're you going to do now?

00:12:21.708 --> 00:12:23.917
Shino invited me to her house.

00:12:23.917 --> 00:12:25.167
Shino?

00:12:25.167 --> 00:12:29.833
Shino Sasaki. The girl with long hair,
who was with me when I took your test.

00:12:29.833 --> 00:12:32.833
Oh, that girl. Are you two close?

00:12:32.833 --> 00:12:34.875
Yes, we're very close!

00:12:34.875 --> 00:12:36.083
I see.

00:12:37.083 --> 00:12:38.750
"Pedestrians and Bicycles"

00:12:39.083 --> 00:12:40.833
Well then, see you later.

00:12:40.833 --> 00:12:42.292
Okay!

00:12:46.917 --> 00:12:48.750
Akari!

00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:50.250
Shino!

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:53.042
Done with your duty? Shall we go now?

00:12:53.042 --> 00:12:57.250
Yep! This is my first time visiting your house,
so I'm looking forward to it!

00:12:59.458 --> 00:13:02.792
Whoa! This is amazing! It's like a castle!

00:13:04.917 --> 00:13:07.375
Sh-She's cute!

00:13:07.375 --> 00:13:11.375
--I should've brought a digital camera with me.
--Whoa! This is cool!

00:13:11.375 --> 00:13:12.792
Welcome back.

00:13:12.792 --> 00:13:14.583
Wow...!

00:13:14.583 --> 00:13:16.167
Oh, my...

00:13:16.167 --> 00:13:17.625
How cute!

00:13:17.625 --> 00:13:18.917
Miss Shino...

00:13:18.917 --> 00:13:20.375
...brought her friend home...

00:13:20.375 --> 00:13:22.833
...for the first time!

00:13:22.833 --> 00:13:26.625
Akari, it might become bothersome
to carry a gun inside the house,

00:13:26.625 --> 00:13:28.583
so we'll keep it for you.

00:13:28.583 --> 00:13:30.625
Yeah, you're right.

00:13:30.625 --> 00:13:32.792
--Here you go.
--We'll keep it for you.

00:13:41.083 --> 00:13:43.292
This tastes good!

00:13:43.292 --> 00:13:46.458
Shino, this leaf is edible, too, right?

00:13:46.458 --> 00:13:51.333
Yes. Caraway's young leaves
get rid of the meat's smell.

00:13:51.333 --> 00:13:52.625
It's similar to parsley.

00:13:52.625 --> 00:13:54.042
I see!

00:13:54.042 --> 00:13:58.708
The lemon balm over there has
calming and cardiotonic effects.

00:13:58.708 --> 00:14:02.875
If you chew one leaf before a battle,
you can exhibit your full power.

00:14:02.875 --> 00:14:06.833
Wow, Shino! You're very knowledgeable!

00:14:06.833 --> 00:14:09.667
Well... not really...

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:14.250
I like her! I like her!

00:14:14.250 --> 00:14:15.750
I like her so much!

00:14:25.667 --> 00:14:27.125
Your garden is big!

00:14:27.125 --> 00:14:30.417
There is a fountain and
an herb garden over there.

00:14:30.417 --> 00:14:34.125
It's incredible that the garden
is big enough to take a walk.

00:14:38.208 --> 00:14:41.042
It's getting a bit chilly, isn't it?

00:14:46.083 --> 00:14:49.125
Shino, these doors are locked.

00:14:50.708 --> 00:14:52.042
Shino?

00:14:52.042 --> 00:14:58.417
Akari, do you know about
the three-day cancelation rule?

00:14:58.417 --> 00:15:01.542
In the Amica Contract, there's a rule
that if the younger sister fights a battle

00:15:01.542 --> 00:15:04.375
and loses within 72 hours of the contract,

00:15:04.375 --> 00:15:07.708
the contract gets terminated.

00:15:07.708 --> 00:15:10.708
This is because the upperclassman
couldn't protect her junior.

00:15:12.042 --> 00:15:14.292
After that, the contract may not be re-signed.

00:15:14.292 --> 00:15:16.417
I didn't know such a rule existed!

00:15:16.417 --> 00:15:20.833
Our contract was approved
at 8PM three days ago.

00:15:20.833 --> 00:15:23.042
So fifteen more minutes to go.

00:15:23.042 --> 00:15:27.375
Akari, I let you keep your knife,
so you can draw it.

00:15:27.375 --> 00:15:28.500
Huh?

00:15:32.083 --> 00:15:33.708
Shino?

00:15:38.917 --> 00:15:40.750
Akari...

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:42.917
...break up with Aria.

00:15:50.333 --> 00:15:53.375
Although a sword can't cut
the bulletproof uniform itself,

00:15:53.375 --> 00:15:55.875
it might break your bones.

00:15:55.875 --> 00:15:57.208
But...

00:16:00.667 --> 00:16:03.625
I'll be at your side all
the time to care for you.

00:16:16.958 --> 00:16:18.083
Don't come near me!

00:16:18.083 --> 00:16:22.458
You're agile. Just like a swallow.

00:16:23.708 --> 00:16:28.292
But I can... cut even a swallow.

00:16:28.292 --> 00:16:31.000
That technique is dangerous!

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:34.125
In the Gan-ryu, the swordsmanship
passed down in the Sasaki Family,

00:16:34.125 --> 00:16:38.625
we first learn <i>iai-giri </i>and
then do it without the sheath.

00:16:38.625 --> 00:16:41.917
The <i>iai </i>without the friction from the
sheath is the fastest sword technique.

00:16:41.917 --> 00:16:44.500
So I'll discard the sheath first.

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:47.417
I haven't mastered this
secret technique yet, but...

00:16:47.417 --> 00:16:48.958
Tsubame Gaeshi!

00:16:55.042 --> 00:16:56.917
Akari...

00:16:56.917 --> 00:16:58.125
Huh?!

00:16:58.958 --> 00:17:02.000
It's your fault, Akari.

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:05.500
You're lucky! This is the last pie.

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:07.375
I wanna by a Leaf Pie, please!

00:17:07.375 --> 00:17:10.000
Ugh! Sold out again?!

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:13.167
Well, uhm... I was just looking.

00:17:13.167 --> 00:17:15.500
Are you sure?!

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:17.000
Thank you!

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:18.542
I'll give you half.

00:17:18.542 --> 00:17:22.208
We're very lucky that we can
eat a fresh pie from the oven!

00:17:26.542 --> 00:17:27.625
This is delicious.

00:17:27.625 --> 00:17:29.292
Isn't it?!

00:17:29.292 --> 00:17:32.708
Ah, I-I'll pay for half!

00:17:32.708 --> 00:17:34.083
Ah...

00:17:34.083 --> 00:17:35.208
I've got only credit cards...

00:17:35.208 --> 00:17:38.333
You can pay me any time. It's okay,
even if you pay me back much later!

00:17:38.333 --> 00:17:39.750
Even much later?

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:45.458
Yep. Now that we've become
friends, we'll be friends forever!

00:17:45.458 --> 00:17:48.083
My first friend...

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:55.042
I don't wanna lose you.

00:17:55.042 --> 00:17:57.542
That's why I cut you!

00:17:57.542 --> 00:18:01.042
Akari... break up with Aria.

00:18:01.042 --> 00:18:03.167
Shino...

00:18:03.167 --> 00:18:05.042
Why...?

00:18:10.208 --> 00:18:13.667
I'm gonna become Aria's Amica for sure!

00:18:16.917 --> 00:18:20.250
That sword... If I take
that sword away from her...

00:18:21.417 --> 00:18:23.792
I'll use Tobiugachi to take that sword!

00:18:23.792 --> 00:18:26.167
I know about that technique of yours.

00:18:26.167 --> 00:18:30.583
You used it when you were
fighting Aria the other day.

00:18:30.583 --> 00:18:35.458
If you're trying to take something away
from me, it would be this sword, right?

00:18:35.458 --> 00:18:37.417
I made a deduction...

00:18:37.417 --> 00:18:41.792
...that you might not be able to use
it if the opponent is out of your reach.

00:18:41.792 --> 00:18:45.500
In other words, you can use it
only when you get close to them.

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:49.333
A samurai would always carry
a long sword and a short sword.

00:18:49.333 --> 00:18:52.833
What I've been using up until now
is a short sword in the Gan-ryu style.

00:18:52.833 --> 00:18:55.917
And this is the long sword.

00:18:55.917 --> 00:18:58.167
It's commonly called a "laundry pole."

00:18:58.167 --> 00:19:00.292
I-It's long!

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:07.958
Aria can't have you, Akari!

00:19:09.125 --> 00:19:11.167
You think... you dodged it?!

00:19:17.917 --> 00:19:19.667
This is it for you.

00:19:19.667 --> 00:19:21.208
Akari!

00:19:23.333 --> 00:19:25.375
If you want to become my Amica,

00:19:25.375 --> 00:19:27.958
you should be able to take care
of things like this yourself.

00:19:28.958 --> 00:19:30.583
You stay there.

00:19:30.583 --> 00:19:33.542
Now that you've seen this, you're next.

00:19:34.792 --> 00:19:38.000
Akari is... mine!

00:19:40.875 --> 00:19:43.083
A bulletproof tie?!

00:19:51.083 --> 00:19:53.750
Aria! What're you doing here?!

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:57.292
That girl was acting a little strange, so...

00:20:00.667 --> 00:20:02.542
You won.

00:20:12.542 --> 00:20:15.375
Akari now hates me!

00:20:15.375 --> 00:20:18.375
I'm back to being alone again!

00:20:18.375 --> 00:20:20.875
Shino...

00:20:20.875 --> 00:20:25.083
I'm sorry. Looks like I've been
insensitive to your feelings.

00:20:25.083 --> 00:20:28.417
I don't hate you, Shino.

00:20:30.167 --> 00:20:32.208
Really?

00:20:32.208 --> 00:20:35.250
You don't hate me?

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:36.583
Nope!

00:20:36.583 --> 00:20:40.083
Then, you like me?! Do you like me?!

00:20:40.083 --> 00:20:41.042
Y-Yeah.

00:20:41.042 --> 00:20:43.542
Akari! I like you so much, too!

00:20:43.542 --> 00:20:47.750
Akari! We're friends, right? Right? Right?!

00:20:51.917 --> 00:20:56.000
I wonder how they're doing after that...

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:59.708
If I went through something
like that with an acquaintance,

00:20:59.708 --> 00:21:01.667
I might cut them out of my life.

00:21:07.917 --> 00:21:09.792
What's wrong, Akari?

00:21:09.792 --> 00:21:11.167
You look down.

00:21:11.167 --> 00:21:14.875
Y-Yeah... Something happened yesterday.

00:21:14.875 --> 00:21:17.833
I wonder if Shino's okay.

00:21:17.833 --> 00:21:19.583
Good morning!

00:21:19.583 --> 00:21:22.250
Sh-Shino! About yesterday--

00:21:22.250 --> 00:21:23.542
Akari!

00:21:23.542 --> 00:21:25.792
I did some research after you left.

00:21:25.792 --> 00:21:28.208
Do you know about the Amica group?

00:21:28.208 --> 00:21:29.792
Amica group?

00:21:29.792 --> 00:21:32.875
It's a system in which some younger
sisters get together and form a group.

00:21:32.875 --> 00:21:37.458
They each receive instructions from their
own older sister and work together to train.

00:21:37.458 --> 00:21:41.958
So I requested an Amica Contract,
too, with Hotogi from Year 2.

00:21:41.958 --> 00:21:42.917
Whoa!

00:21:42.917 --> 00:21:47.125
Akari! Let's you and I form
an Amica group! Okay? Okay?

00:21:47.125 --> 00:21:48.000
Huh?

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:50.875
Because we like each other so much, right?

00:21:50.875 --> 00:21:52.208
Sh-Shino...

00:21:52.208 --> 00:21:56.458
Right? You told me that you liked me, right?

00:21:56.458 --> 00:21:57.792
I did, but...

00:21:57.792 --> 00:21:59.542
You guys...

00:21:59.542 --> 00:22:02.083
...just don't do anything weird, okay?

00:22:02.083 --> 00:22:05.417
Huh? They made up?

00:22:05.417 --> 00:22:06.958
Really...

00:22:06.958 --> 00:22:07.542
"Episode 2: Dangerous Relationship"

00:22:07.542 --> 00:22:10.458
...she <i>is </i>a strange girl.

00:23:41.625 --> 00:23:47.833
--Raika is my one and only prince!
--I wish I could be a girly girl like her.

00:23:47.833 --> 00:23:52.125
If I win, I want you to make me your Amica.

00:23:52.125 --> 00:23:55.250
If I win, don't follow me around anymore.

00:23:55.250 --> 00:23:56.203
"Episode 3: Applying to be an Amica"
If I win, don't follow me around anymore.
